{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111558","id":3507317705,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7RDWvJ","number":111558,"title":"Exporting enum from partial class (with .g.cs generated part) fails with GD0102","user":{"login":"mikenlanggio","id":24709592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzA5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24709592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio","html_url":"https://github.com/mikenlanggio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikenlanggio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-12T14:50:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T11:45:28Z","closed_at":"2026-05-16T11:45:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5 stable mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting an enum defined inside a `partial` class that has part of its definition generated automatically in a `.g.cs` file, Godot raises the following build error:\n```\nThe type of the exported member 'MyNamespace.MyScript._mapName1' is not supported (GD0102)\n```\n\nHowever, the same enum definition works fine if it is declared in a normal (non-generated) partial class or a top-level enum.\n\nThis suggests that the Godot C# exporter fails to recognize enums defined inside a partial class when one part of that class comes from a generated .g.cs file\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a `partial` class manually\n```\npublic partial class MapDefined { }\n```\n2. Generate another file `MapDefined.g.cs` (by a code generator, e.g. Roslyn) with:\n```\npublic partial class MapDefined\n{\n    public enum Enum\n    {\n        City,\n        Corridor\n    }\n}\n```\n\n3. In another script, try exporting a field of that enum\n```\n[Export]\nprivate MapDefined.Enum _mapName1;\n```\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n.","closed_by":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111558/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}